WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
A small four-rotor aircraft appears above a rendered city street. A broad yellow path or trail meets the aircraft. The camera follows it from changing rear and elevated views.

00:06.500 --> 00:13.000
The view looks across a street intersection with cars and pedestrian crossings between multistory buildings. The aircraft remains in view as the camera angle changes.

00:13.000 --> 00:20.930
The camera moves closer to a building facade and then alongside the aircraft. The yellow trace curves and extends across the image. The simulation ends beside the buildings.
